# Code owners for domino-ai-plugin.
#
# Every skill directory has its own line, so each skill has named owners. A new or renamed
# skill must add or update its line in the same PR; `scripts/check-codeowners.py` fails CI
# otherwise, and also fails on a line that points at a directory that no longer exists.
#
# Owners are mapped from cerebrotech/documentation/.github/CODEOWNERS (product-area owners per
# docs section). The docs team (@cerebrotech/cx-docs) lives in a different GitHub org and cannot
# be referenced here, so the docs maintainer is listed by handle. MAINTAINERS.md says who is
# accountable for the repository as a whole.
#
# GitHub semantics: the LAST matching line wins and REPLACES the owner list, so every line
# carries its complete set of owners. An owner without write access is ignored by GitHub and
# shows as an error under the repository's CODEOWNERS view; owners listed here are expected to
# have write access. Branch protection requires a code-owner review, so a PR needs approval from
# someone on the matching line other than its author.

